"""packs/law.py -- the law discipline pack.

Covers: Law (LLB), Common and Islamic Law, Public, Private and Commercial
Law courses, and Criminology and Security Studies adjacent legal courses.

Every atom teaches real Nigerian law: the 1999 Constitution, the Land Use
Act 1978, the Criminal and Penal Codes, the Evidence Act 2011, the Sale of
Goods Act 1893, CAMA 2020, the Legal Practitioners Act, and the classic
common law authorities as applied in Nigerian courts. The {S} slot is
woven into every paragraph so the same section serves every course of
the discipline, from law to islamic law to criminology and security
studies. All numeric quiz answers were verified with Python arithmetic
before keying.
"""

