        "Confusing personnel bodies is common: the Body of Benchers calls lawyers, the NJC recommends judges, the Legal Practitioners Disciplinary Committee disciplines them, and the NBA is the association, not the regulator. Mixing these up in {S} answers suggests unfamiliarity with the profession, so memorise each body's function and its statute.",
